fixture zone1_03_optional_way_back
doc Room 03's optional path ends in the low hall past the tunnel (BUILD.md s3 hidden rooms hold a Lantern-tier Votive; s5 tech 3); the way back is a walk: east along the hall, off its end into the 3-tile shaft, a 352 u drop to the main east hall's floor (no fall damage, no hazard), and 70 u on to the east door. Missing the chain costs only a hazard; nothing here is a gate.
room zone1/03_pogo_chain
spawn 3700 320
frames 120
input
  0..39 R
  75..119 R
end
expect
  # Off the upper hall's end (4000 u) into the shaft, down to the main level (672 u).
  mark floor 0..119 event.land=1
  at floor x>4000u y=672u
  never 0..119 event.hazard=1
  mark door 0..119 event.room=1
  at door room=zone1_04_pogo_dash_reset
end
